Google Ads Manager AI Plugin
https://github.com/nexoradev-stack/google-ads-manager-ai-plugin

This product includes software derived from "google-ads-claude-plugin"
by Neelkant Ekbote (https://github.com/eneelkant/google-ads-claude-plugin),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes made in this repository include: a preview-and-confirm safety gate on
19 spend, launch and removal tools; server-side spend limits; bearer-token
login, rate limiting, allowed-host checks and a /health endpoint for remote
transports; a fix so set_campaign_status(REMOVED) can no longer skip removal
confirmation; new tests; and rewritten documentation.
